.TH "VINPUT\-DAEMON" "1" "September 2026" "fcitx5\-vinput" "fcitx5\-vinput User Manual"
.SH NAME
vinput\-daemon \- Background speech recognition and processing daemon
for fcitx5\-vinput
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]vinput\-daemon\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\f[B]vinput\-daemon\f[R] is the background service component of
\f[B]fcitx5\-vinput\f[R].
It communicates with the Fcitx5 addon over D\-Bus
(\f[CR]org.fcitx.Vinput\f[R]).
.PP
The daemon is responsible for:
.IP \(bu 2
Capturing microphone audio via \f[B]PipeWire\f[R].
.IP \(bu 2
Offline speech\-to\-text recognition powered by \f[B]sherpa\-onnx\f[R].
.IP \(bu 2
Forwarding streaming or batch audio to cloud ASR provider scripts.
.IP \(bu 2
Voice Activity Detection (\f[B]VAD\f[R]) to filter silence.
.IP \(bu 2
Post\-processing and rewriting recognized text using OpenAI\-compatible
LLM APIs.
.IP \(bu 2
Managing background LLM adapter processes.
.IP \(bu 2
Dynamic system audio ducking via \f[B]WirePlumber\f[R] during recording.
.SH RUNTIME LIFECYCLE & SERVICE
\f[B]vinput\-daemon\f[R] is designed to run as a systemd user service or
start on demand via D\-Bus activation.
.TP
Start daemon immediately:
\f[CR]systemctl \-\-user start vinput\-daemon.service\f[R]
.TP
Enable daemon on user login:
\f[CR]systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now vinput\-daemon.service\f[R]
.TP
View daemon logs:
\f[CR]journalctl \-\-user \-u vinput\-daemon.service \-f\f[R]
.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.TP
\f[B]VINPUT_CAPTURE_REUSE\f[R]
Controls whether to keep a connected but inactive PipeWire capture
stream alive after recording ends (default: \f[CR]1\f[R]).
This warm\-path mechanism significantly reduces latency on subsequent
voice triggers.
Set to \f[CR]0\f[R] to destroy the capture stream immediately upon
recording completion.
.TP
\f[B]VINPUT_CAPTURE_IDLE_DESTROY_MS\f[R]
Idle grace period in milliseconds before destroying an inactive reusable
PipeWire stream (default: \f[CR]15000\f[R], 15 seconds).
.TP
\f[B]VINPUT_DEBUG\f[R]
Set to \f[CR]1\f[R] to enable verbose debugging logs in stdout/journald.
.TP
\f[B]VINPUT_CONFIG_PATH\f[R]
Override the path to \f[CR]config.json\f[R].
.SH PRIVACY & AUDIO CAPTURE
When the capture warm path is active, \f[B]audio is never read or
buffered into memory\f[R] while recording is inactive.
After the idle grace period expires, the stream is fully closed and
destroyed.
.SH FILES
.TP
\f[I]\(ti/.config/vinput/config.json\f[R]
